cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or digital twin framework in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Haptic Needle Twin (UE5): A Logic-Gated Digital Twin Framework for Tactile-Sensing Medical Needle Insertion Simulation"
abstract: >-
  A real-time Unreal Engine 5 digital twin framework for simulating cannula
  and needle insertion procedures using haptic-augmented physical inputs and
  soft-body electronics. The architecture interfaces an Arduino-driven tactile
  sensor array with UE5 via low-latency serial streaming, enforcing procedural
  correctness through logic-gated insertion constraints where tactile semantics
  and sensor alignment govern physical simulation possibility rather than
  pre-scripted animations.
